  "instructions": [
    "heat oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "add slices of ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "add minced garlic and onion, cook until fragrant.",
    "add beef broth, fish sauce, soy sauce, lime juice and bring to a boil.",
    "add peaches and cook until tender, 10-12 minutes.",
